2. How do you debug a pod stuck in Pending state?

Answer:
 • Check events → kubectl describe pod <name>
 • Common issues:
 • No available nodes (scheduler failure)
 • Insufficient resources (CPU/Memory)
 • Node selectors/taints not matching
 • PVC claim not bound
 • Use kubectl get events --sort-by=.metadata.creationTimestamp for detailed reasons.

