3. How do you achieve multi-tenancy in Kubernetes?

Answer:
 • Separate workloads by Namespaces
 • Apply ResourceQuotas and LimitRanges per namespace
 • Use NetworkPolicies to isolate traffic
 • Apply RBAC to restrict access
 • Optionally use OPA Gatekeeper or Kyverno for policy enforcement

