4. How would you implement canary deployments in Kubernetes?

Answer:
 • Create two deployments (stable + canary) with different labels
 • Use a Service or Ingress with weighted routing (via Nginx ingress annotations or service mesh like Istio/Linkerd)
 • Gradually shift traffic from stable to canary
 • Rollback if metrics/logs show failures

