5. How do you secure communication between microservices inside the cluster?

Answer:
 • Enable mTLS using a service mesh (Istio/Linkerd)
 • Use NetworkPolicies for L3/L4 security
 • Implement PodSecurityPolicy (deprecated → use Pod Security Admission)
 • Rotate TLS certificates automatically with cert-manager

