7. How do you manage Kubernetes manifests across environments (Dev, QA, Prod)?

Answer:
 • Use Helm charts with separate values.yaml per environment
 • Use Kustomize with overlays (dev/, staging/, prod/)
 • Use GitOps tools like ArgoCD or FluxCD to sync manifests from Git

